<i>Those cold days
are history to us</i>


01:37:22.000 --> 01:37:25.083
<i>I'm not sayin'
times they won't get tough</i>


01:37:27.960 --> 01:37:31.043
<i>We still got each other
That's enough</i>


01:37:34.160 --> 01:37:37.482
<i>I know life
ain't simple for you, dear</i>


01:37:39.960 --> 01:37:43.123
<i>But I'm here,
