01:37:46.120 --> 01:37:49.044
<i>I'm not sayin'
I know how you feel</i>


01:37:52.000 --> 01:37:55.288
<i>I just know
that I can help you deal</i>


01:37:57.000 --> 01:37:59.446
<i>Don't lose your mind</i>


01:37:59.840 --> 01:38:02.491
<i>Don't lose your good heart</i>


01:38:02.920 --> 01:38:05.048
<i>Just know this time</i>


01:38:05.960 --> 01:38:11.126
<i>That you'll be waking up
